# Ignore common generated and backup files
*DMs Root*
*.bak
*.zip
*.DS_Store*
*__pycache__/
*.obsidian/workspace.json
*logs
*.log

# Runtime SQLite DB (hot-contention fields cache) - fully regenerable from
# the vault via Mycelium/scripts/Python/rebuild_database.py
mycelium_runtime.db
mycelium_runtime.db-wal
mycelium_runtime.db-shm
# All paths that contain the word "Collectionfiles" or "ExpandedCollections"
*/deleted/
# Ignore backups and vault/workspace folders
backups/
*.bak

# ---- Mycelium vault handling ----
# We want to completely ignore any working Mycelium vault content so that
# local/generated files in the Mycelium folder are never committed.
#
# - Ignore the canonical vault directory and any sibling folders that start
#   with "Mycelium_" (these are working or intermediate folders).
Mycelium/*
!Mycelium/scripts/
Mycelium_*



# Note: If Mycelium files were already committed, remove them from the index
# with: `git rm -r --cached Mycelium` and commit the change. That will ensure
# the ignore rules take effect for future commits.
